"Hello %(name)s,\n"
"\n"
"OlhóCão created your customer account. Use the secure link below to choose your password:\n"
"%(url)s\n"
"\n"
"Your username is: %(username)s\n"
"\n"
"If you were not expecting this invitation, contact OlhóCão."
